parison matters because of what missed calls cost. Roughly 62% of calls to small businesses go unanswered and up to 85% of those callers never call back (",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://oncrew.ai/resources/missed-call-statistics","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","children":"missed call statistics"}],"). McKinsey has documented AI agents cutting cost per call by around half in production deployments (",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.cxtoday.com/contact-center/why-voice-ai-adoption-is-accelerating-in-2026/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","children":"CX Today"}],")."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"hidden-costs","children":"Hidden costs to ask about"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Separate charges for speech recognition, language model and text-to-speech on \"bring your own keys\" plans."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Phone number rental and carrier minutes."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Minimum monthly commitments or prepaid minute bundles that expire."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Fees for CRM connectors or calendar integrations."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Charges for call recording storage and transcripts."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Change requests after launch if prompt tuning is not included."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"roi","children":"How to judge whether it pays off"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Count last month's missed calls and multiply by your average booking value and close rate. Add the staff hours spent on routine booking and FAQ calls. If that number is larger than the quoted monthly cost, the agent pays for itself, and it usually is by a wide margin. Contacting a lead within five minutes makes a business 21 times more likely to qualify it than waiting 30 minutes (",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.chilipiper.com/article/speed-to-lead-statistics","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer nofollow","children":"MIT / InsideSales study"}],"), which is the other half of the return."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"syenxa-pricing","children":"How Syenxa Tech prices AI calling agents"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["We charge a fixed, quoted setup fee that covers script design, voice selection, calendar and CRM integration, TCPA and call-recording compliance configuration and a test period. Usage is billed per minute at a rate set by your volume and languages. Unlimited concurrent calls, transcripts, human handoff and ongoing tuning are included. Every engagement starts with a free consultation and a live demo on your own scripts. See the full breakdown on our"," ",["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/ai-calling-agents","children":"AI calling agents page"}]," ","or ",["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/contact","children":"request a quote"}],"."]}]]}]]}]}]],null,["$","$Le",null,{"children":"$Lf"}]]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],["$","$1","h",{"children":[null,["$","$1","5ORaIHR35Y3rF1plqpZUI",{"children":[["$","$L10",null,{"children":"$L11"}],["$","$L12",null,{"children":"$L13"}],null]}]]}],false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$14","$undefined"],"s":false,"S":true}
